BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 618.00 Td (grounding check and the keyword index is still poorly understood. Most prior methods treat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 605.00 Td (the passage index as fixed and tune the dense embedding around it.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.0 Tf 72.00 585.00 Td (1 Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 565.00 Td (Practitioners report that the reranker is the first component to fail on long inputs. This) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 552.00 Td (work studies BEACON, a method that rethinks the dense embedding. A practical system has to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 539.00 Td (balance the cost of the query rewrite against the quality of the citation. Despite steady) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 526.00 Td (progress, the interaction between the context window and the query rewrite is still poorly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 513.00 Td (understood.) Tj ET
