BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 480.00 Td (it. Practitioners report that the keyword index is the first component to fail on long) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 467.00 Td (inputs. This work studies BEACON, a method that rethinks the passage index.) Tj ET
