BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 427.00 Td (A limitation of BEACON is that the citation must be tuned separately for each model size. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 414.00 Td (expect the chunk size to interact with the dense embedding at larger scales, which we leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 401.00 Td (to future work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 72.00 381.00 Td (The citation in BEACON is parameterised by a small linear layer with 256 hidden units. Each) Tj ET
